_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"78\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/b6a8c2e7e2e219c3585a4a1aaf700507.avif?t=1786356226\" width=\"1088\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"498\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/123c4e99619fa7c9fb807ab107116422.poster.avif?t=1786356226\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/123c4e99619fa7c9fb807ab107116422.webm?t=1786356226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/123c4e99619fa7c9fb807ab107116422.mp4?t=1786356226\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Assemble a band of eccentric lemur artists, manage your tour bus through mini-games, and build your band\u2019s popularity among locals to perform on bigger stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"78\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/083585301ad33d7979ea47c6f6458b02.avif?t=1786356226\" width=\"1088\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"496\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/59e0be61d8ea6237853ed3cf71fc1575.poster.avif?t=1786356226\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/59e0be61d8ea6237853ed3cf71fc1575.webm?t=1786356226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/59e0be61d8ea6237853ed3cf71fc1575.mp4?t=1786356226\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A world inspired by Madagascar\u2019s folklore. Once a paradise, it now<strong> </strong>suffers under the witch Raneny\u2019s ruthless rule. Having grown tired of exploiting its people, she decided to host a huge concert with the island\u2019s most famous band. You\u2019re sent on a mission to fight back by rallying legendary musicians to your cause!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"78\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/fe6a6ec65f6f85cc4d8916697abee686.avif?t=1786356226\" width=\"1088\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"524\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/a79b6955120f981cbe63be584b540b0b.poster.avif?t=1786356226\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/a79b6955120f981cbe63be584b540b0b.webm?t=1786356226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158820/extras/a79b6955120f981cbe63be584b540b0b.mp4?t=1786356226\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dash through diverse biomes across Lemuria, save and befriend funky locals to form your crew, and jump over industrial platforming traps to become Lemuria\u2019s number one band and finally face Raneny!\u00a0</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Kalanoro is an action-adventure platformer where you build a band of lemur artists. Explore Lemuria, recruit lemur musicians, grow your band and use platforming and combat to fight t